{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43514","headline":"河鲤登龙门 · 无名氏","name":"河鲤登龙门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年久还求变，今来有所从。\n得名当是鲤，无点可成龙。\n备历艰难徧，因期造化容。\n泥沙宁不阻，钓饵莫相逢。\n击浪因成势，纤鳞莫继踪。\n若令摇尾去，雨露此时浓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43514.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43514","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}